# The design-fidelity capture directory.
#
# NOTHING in here is source. The PNGs are evidence for a human eye, regenerated
# by `node design-lab/pass.mjs` in about a minute, and they are large. They are
# left untracked deliberately.
#
# `.session.json` is the reason this file exists rather than a line in the
# repo-root ignore: it is a COOKIE JAR. The captures need a signed-in workspace,
# so `design-lab/session.mjs` walks the real passwordless flow once and caches
# the resulting session cookies here. They belong to a seeded synthetic identity
# on a local Supabase and are worthless anywhere else — but a live session token
# is still a live session token, and `git add -A` in this directory must not be
# the only thing standing between it and a public history.
*

# ...except this rule, which has to travel with the directory to be worth
# anything. Without it the `*` above hides the protection itself.
!.gitignore
